        36,
        617.56640000000004,
        237.01999999999987,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "category that can cause a pilot to ignore all the other risk"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        36,
        605.06640000000004,
        237.01299999999998,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "factors. External pressures put time-related pressure on the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        36,
        592.56640000000004,
        176.09000000000006,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "pilot and figure into a majority of accidents."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        36,
        567.56640000000004,
        237.11000000000001,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "The use of personal standard operating procedures (SOPs) is"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        36,
        555.06640000000004,
        237.08699999999993,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "one way to manage external pressures. The goal is to supply a"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        36,
        542.56640000000004,
        236.99999999999989,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "release for the external pressures of a flight. These procedures"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        36,
        530.06640000000004,
        118.61000000000004,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "include but are not limited to:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        45,
        513.06640000000004,
        3.5,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "•"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63,
        513.06640000000004,
        210.01999999999998,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "Allow time on a trip for an extra fuel stop or to make"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63,
        500.56640000000004,
        171.61000000000001,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "an unexpected landing because of weather."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        45,
        483.56640000000004,
        3.5,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "•"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63,
        483.56640000000004,
        210.02400000000006,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "Have alternate plans for a late arrival or make backup"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63,
        471.06640000000004,
        171.35000000000005,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "airline reservations for must-be-there trips."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        45,
        454.06640000000004,
        228.00600000000003,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "• For really important trips, plan to leave early enough"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63,
        441.56640000000004,
        209.89999999999998,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "so that there would still be time to drive to the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63,
        429.06640000000004,
        98.870000000000005,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "destination, if necessary."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        294,
        719.56640000000004,
        3.5,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "•"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        719.56640000000004,
        210,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "Advise those who are waiting at the destination that"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        707.06640000000004,
        210,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "the arrival may be delayed. Know how to notify them"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        694.56640000000004,
        118.29000000000002,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "when delays are encountered."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        294,
        677.56640000000004,
        3.5,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "•"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        677.56640000000004,
        209.97000000000003,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "Manage passengers’ expectations. Make sure"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        665.06640000000004,
        210.00999999999999,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "passengers know that they might not arrive on a firm"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        652.56640000000004,
        210.0139999999999,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "schedule, and if they must arrive by a certain time,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        640.06640000000004,
        141.37,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "they should make alternative plans."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        294,
        623.06640000000004,
        228.00999999999999,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "• Eliminate pressure to return home, even on a casual"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        610.56640000000004,
        210.02300000000014,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "day flight, by carrying a small overnight kit containing"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        598.06640000000004,
        210.13999999999987,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "prescriptions, contact lens solutions, toiletries, or other"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        312,
        585.56640000000004,
        106.65000000000003,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "necessities on every flight."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        560.56640000000004,
        236.99399999999991,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "The key to managing external pressure is to be ready for"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        548.06640000000004,
        237.01099999999997,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "and accept delays. Remember that people get delayed when"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        535.56640000000004,
        236.92999999999995,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "traveling on airlines, driving a car, or taking a bus. The pilot’s"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        523.06640000000004,
        220.76999999999998,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "goal is to manage risk, not create hazards. [Figure 2-7]"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 12,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        494.88240000000002,
        86.915999999999997,
        15.827999999999975
      ],
      "text" : "Human Factors"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        480.1164,
        237.01499999999987,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "Why are human conditions, such as fatigue, complacency"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        467.6164,
        236.99599999999998,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "and stress, so important in aviation? These conditions, along"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        455.1164,
        237.005,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "with many others, are called human factors. Human factors"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        285,
        442.6164,
        237.00399999999991,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "directly cause or contribute to many aviation accidents and"
    }
